{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9a24b52524d6594581f53c25da686c0fe01e29e83f170f3e91c4b6719c8e4cb9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49c27eee389ca2930c196c5faac66564edf58b4c9e31a209373d4f2601cd1498",
      "text": "抱歉啊，连贴海报都让你们帮忙。\n不过，多亏了你们，现在已经成话题了呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be01c4ffc55fd59cff37b024e14770165d4a84edfe84ae691b62ecd02fdfd722",
      "text": "大会虽然还有一阵子才开，但来店里的孩子\n已经变多了……总觉得我已经心满意足了啊。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b958bd0dc28508da8d6c2e9c22e865eeb37f54a0330624101f8b15774eba554b",
      "text": "说什么呢，正式演出现在才刚要开始吧。\n我们可是有把活动办得大获成功的自信呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d767c97c26b3ecd8205ad9e1b79c6f8e53e2198a12638e83a6c69b7bfd2ba82f",
      "text": "就是说啊，老爷爷。\n好好期待当天的到来吧？",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77d85397cf574fc54d7aa08838d2f125b2faa006f93be22a02e4b38f9121a784",
      "text": "……秀、百百人。能耽误一下吗。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b6c9b5d26fc3de17bb5008bc667ca45c31d17d6eaa597b31125118114483e32",
      "text": "关于大会的宣传，\n有些事正是因为是我们才能做到的。……例如。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:062292ef562a35f42215fb618efc1f6183023084d0ca25bc96ebca9924f9cc48",
      "text": "要不要试着向身边的人寻求协助？\n我打算明天在晨会上向全校学生进行呼吁。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b3a5c09ca55955789e7558c4c1b8ba7af43c5b563158f6f463e65cc5cbd1e34",
      "text": "呵呵，真是学生会长特权呢。那我也\n试着去拜托一下学校里的大家吧～。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8841bbeb63d3f58af77753a43bf2730091de5caa295399fa079790c3c55c3a5f",
      "text": "拜托了。滥用权力固然不是值得称赞的行为，\n但现在比起这个，我更想去实现那位店主的梦想。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:802841aa575d2157a948ae2ff4c990b203477ef2e3e0dcde36a74c03af611261",
      "text": "（……怎么办。我跟学校里的那些家伙，\n又没有那么熟络）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000153:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef8f1e31c8467728b4c8fa74211a3d722659cd5a36daacc78cd44c94b9b54f3",
      "text": "秀的房间",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5910f6bac24dfdb5748b08ddd047e10a9b556c68a6a765697e2205c9569a9658",
      "text": "……说起来，班里的人好像拉我进过一个\n群聊来着。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f40bc0538578c73d6a9c62f94aef155eb3be8b2ee6cc6158a9f74f3cabfa5148",
      "text": "（虽然一直晾在一边，试着在里面宣传一下吧。\n大概写成这样……好，多少会有点反应吧）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd0d915efaa1a707455d5e0b9bd3d305e40d32da9b2094431795e51544db65e",
      "text": "哎，不过啊……这可是我第一次发消息，\n甚至有可能都没人认得出是我……等等，哇。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000199:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf1e664fac7c8f75e9c1eb967d5621786e7c1f7b3cbaff8b04574d4b2d3785a1",
      "text": "（回复正以惊人的势头刷屏。\n“终于联系我们了！”“绝对去！”这样啊）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4e78f318a9920d3edf3bff464fd128d1f187e4e24c226d3954d503d971654d6",
      "text": "真是的。大家也未免太喜欢我了吧。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_02:1_4_001_02_h:cmd-000213:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16f3d1ee4ab319c16a983a90e114f4bf2c6f1a7e4b97bc763edaa1999b8ceeab",
      "text": "（……喂，挚友。\n你也，多少给点反应啊）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
